From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:19:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: move onto the page structure (DumpPage +
 DumpPageContext)

- DumpScreen becomes the DumpPage container; it provides DumpPageContext
  (capture, captureError, loadMore), so DumpComposer takes no props and
  DumpFeed takes entries, hasMore and isAppending.
- The route's feed unwrapping and header week move into the pure adapter
  toDumpPageProps(feed, totalCount, today) in utils/dump.ts, with unit
  tests; the route and the Dump scenarios both call it.
- DumpPageData extends the feed's seed (types/dump.ts), which useDumpFeed
  now takes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
